  "hindi": "इसे शास्त्र के अनुसार पढ़कर उत्तम मनुष्य धर्म के उपदेश से प्रसिद्ध कार्य-अकार्य और शुभ-अशुभ को जान लेता है।",
  "english": "Having studied this according to the rule, the best of men knows what is to be done and what is not to be done, the good and the bad, as made known by the teaching of dharma.",
