  "hindi": "आपत्ति के लिए धन की रक्षा करे, धन से भी पत्नी की रक्षा करे; और अपनी रक्षा सदा करे, पत्नी से भी और धन से भी।",
  "english": "One should guard wealth against adversity, and guard one's wife even by means of wealth; but one should always guard oneself, even by means of wife and even by means of wealth.",
